  "details": "VRChat SDK - Worlds 3.9.0-beta.1\n\nWriting to the VRCCameraSettings.ScreenCamera property causes an error in ClientSim.\n\nThe following error occurs when writing to any property of VRCCameraSettings.ScreenCamera:\n\n--------------------------------------------------------\n\nUdon runtime exception detected!\n\n  An exception occurred during EXTERN to 'VRCSDK3RenderingVRCCameraSettings.__set_AllowHDR__SystemBoolean__SystemVoid'.\n\n      Parameter Addresses: 0x00000051, 0x00000021\n\n   Object reference not set to an instance of an object\n\n--------------------------------------------------------\n\nIn the VRChat client, both Live and Open Beta can write to properties without errors.",
